Hi Li,

Many thanks for your advises. According to your suggestions, I have
modified the --configure-args='--with-graphviz=/usr/lib/graphviz' to
look into executables in "/usr" instead, and it did the job.

$ R CMD INSTALL Rgraphviz_1.16.0.tar.gz
--configure-args='--with-graphviz=/usr'

Thanks again,
Amin.




